---
layout: base.njk
title: Àwọn Àròkọ — Articles
---
<h1>Àwọn Àròkọ — Articles</h1>
<p class="lede-block">Writing on Yoruba language, culture and knowledge from practitioners and scholars, shared with the authors' permission.</p>
{% if collections.articles and collections.articles.length %}
<ul class="article-list">
  {% for a in collections.articles | reverse %}
  <li class="article-card">
    <a href="{{ a.url | url }}"><h2>{{ a.data.title }}</h2></a>
    <p class="article-meta">By {{ a.data.author }}{% if a.data.date %} · {{ a.date | dateFmt }}{% endif %}</p>
    {% if a.data.summary %}<p>{{ a.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p class="thin-notice">The first articles are on their way. If you are a Babaláwo, Ìyáláwo, Òrìṣà devotee or a scholar of Yoruba culture and would like to contribute, <a href="mailto:apakosee@gmail.com?subject={{ 'Ọ̀NÀ article contribution' | urlencode }}">write to us</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
